{"full":"hf:Nenlitio/cropwhisper","spaceId":"Nenlitio/cropwhisper","name":"Cropwhisper","source":"huggingface","description":"AI assistant for small farmers lacking access to agronomists","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","amd","amd-hackathon-2026","vllm","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":4,"created":"2026-05-10T16:07:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-10T17:48:57.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://nenlitio-cropwhisper.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Nenlitio/cropwhisper","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:42.166Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:42.166Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:42.166Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"✦","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AI-Powered Crop Condition Analysis for Smallholder Farmers","CropWhisper is a multimodal agentic AI system that diagnoses crop diseases and nutrient deficiencies from photos, then delivers a plain-language, actionable treatment plan. It is designed for the 500 million+ smallholder farmers worldwide who lack access to agronomists, soil labs, or agricultural extension services — but do have a basic smartphone.","This repository is the demo implementation, built as a Gradio web application. In a production release, CropWhisper would be deployed as a mobile app with real-time camera capture and voice interaction — the farmer points the camera, describes the problem in their own language, and receives a spoken action plan. No literacy or agricultural training required. The Gradio demo replicates the core analytical pipeline while providing a visual interface for testing, evaluation, and stakeholder demonstration."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Nenlitio/cropwhisper/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3d29379b2c24e25453ef1c344d1cbee768f10a8b6191047fd79ef2ac35747524","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:42.286Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-